  --/|Append Beacon query to spell rbutton when row spellhealing uses OGL sheet macros (value may contain | — use block assign).
  --:CAM_SpellBtnApplyBeaconQuery|spellNameKey
  --&thisBeaconString|
  --&CamBtnHealRaw|[:BuiltButtonHash("[%1%]_spellhealing")]
  --?"[&CamBtnHealRaw]" -inc "[&CamOGLHealQuerySig]"|[
   --&thisBeaconString|[&CamBeaconQueryString]
